Story:-
=======
You were in a base on Mars as it was your turn to keep gaurd. Suddenly flying
saucers started attacking you from the sky. It's your job to fight them off.

Installing:-
============
Copy ATTACK.OPA to the \APP directory on any drive and HUD.PIC to a \PIC
directory on any drive. There *must* also be a \OPD directory on the internal
disk for 3D Space Attack to save it's high-scores to.

The two types of game:-
=======================
In Normal mode you have to kill a certain amount of flying saucers on each
level - 10 on level 1, 20 on level 2, 30 on level 3 etc. Every time you are
shot your health meter goes down. You die if your health meter gets to the
bottom.

In VS mode you only start with half health, but every time you shoot a baddy
your health will go up. Every time you are shot your health meter goes down.
You win the level if your health meter gets to the top, but die if it gets to
the bottom. The difficulty setting has no effect on this mode as level 1 is
Easy, level 2 is Normal, level 3 is Hard etc...

Controls:-
==========
Use the cursor keys to aim the target (hold shift at the same time to move
more quickly) and press Space to fire your lasers. You have to shoot a ship
in the black area for it to die.

Shareware:-
===========
If you don't register you can't play above level 2.

